        "value": "<h2 data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"805\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">CLINICAL &amp; FAMILY HISTORY</span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"970\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Clinical Details: ___________________________________________</span><br data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"870\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Family History: ____________________________________________</span><br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">(Attach pedigree chart if required)</span></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1057\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">GENETIC TEST DETAILS</span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1326\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Test Name: _______________________________________________</span><br data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1119\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Genes Involved: __________________________________________</span><br data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1180\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Result: Positive / Negative / Variant of Uncertain Significance (VUS)</span><br data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1252\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Inheritance Pattern: Autosomal Dominant / Autosomal Recessive / X-linked</span></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1408\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">RISK ASSESSMENT</span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1597\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Patient Risk: _____________________________________________</span><br data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1471\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Carrier Risk (Parents/Siblings): _____________________________</span><br data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1536\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Reproductive Risk: ________________________________________</span></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1683\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">COUNSELLING SUMMARY</span></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1883\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1741\">\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1741\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Explanation of test results and clinical implications</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1780\">\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1780\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Recurrence risk for family members</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1826\">\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1826\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Available treatment or management options</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1883\">\n<p data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1883\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Reproductive options (Prenatal diagnosis, PGD, etc.)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1965\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">RECOMMENDATIONS</span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2198\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">[ ] Further genetic testing (specify): ____________________________</span><br data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2036\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">[ ] Family screening recommended</span><br data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2071\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">[ ] Prenatal testing / Preimplantation genetic diagnosis</span><br data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2130\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">[ ] Referral to specialist: ______________________________________</span></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2296\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PATIENT UNDERSTANDING &amp; CONSENT</span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2426\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Patient/guardian acknowledges understanding of the discussion.</span><br data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2362\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Signature: ____________________________ Date: ______________</span></p>",
